specific needs.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Binder</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Measure the standard binder by the linear<MET> meter</MET><ENG> foot</ENG> placed.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Live or Dead Cuttings</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Measure live or dead cuttings by number and type of individual cuttings.  No payment will be made for cuttings 
not required for use in the structure, defective, or that are trimmed from cuttings.  Include all harvesting, 
soaking, transportation, and preparation in the measurement for payment.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Materials</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Measure soil and rock by the [cubic<MET> meter</MET><ENG> yard</ENG>] [<MET>metric</MET><ENG> 2000 pound</ENG> ton].</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
